            <h2 class="reveal text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark leading-tight text-center">Why not hire an in-house developer?</h2> 
            <div class="space-y-6 text-lg text-text-secondary dark:text-text-secondary-dark leading-relaxed">
                <p>Many business owners consider hiring a full time web developer, but it's rarely the most efficient option. A skilled developer can cost £35,000–£50,000 per year once salary, pension, equipment and management time are factored in, and that's before training, software and hosting costs.</p>
                
                <p>For most small businesses, that's overkill. You don't need a full-time developer sitting idle between updates, you need reliable expertise on tap when you need it. That's exactly what CodeCraft North provides. Professional-level development, ongoing maintenance and proactive improvements for a fraction of the cost of hiring internally.</p>
                
                <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary dark:text-text-strong-dark my-8 leading-relaxed">It's like having your own web department, without the overhead.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

